# pr-comments-valid.json.meta
#
# Canonical GitHub issue-comments REST page for PR #42. The provider
# conformance stub serves it when chp_pr_view requests `comments` through
# `gh api repos/<repo>/issues/<pr>/comments --paginate`.
#
# The comments are intentionally out of order so the normalized CHP result
# must sort them by createdAt. Field names match the REST payload
# (`user.login`, `created_at`) rather than the old `gh pr view --json comments`
# connection.
